n_data_begin.wrapping_mul(8))\n        {\n            return -1;\n        }\n        main_data_begin\n    }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":68,"oldLines":24,"newStart":68,"newLines":37,"lines":[" /// The three scalefactor-band tables that the C declares as function-local"," /// `static const uint8_t` arrays."," ///","-/// `sr_idx` is derived from the header and can legitimately reach 8 (sample","-/// rate index 3 combined with the MPEG1 / not-MPEG2.5 version bits), which","-/// indexes one row *past* the end of every `[8][...]` table. The C therefore","-/// performs an out-of-bounds read whose result depends purely on how the","-/// compiler laid the tables out in `.rodata`. GCC emits them contiguously, in","-/// reverse declaration order (`g_scf_mixed`, `g_scf_short`, `g_scf_long`), with","-/// `.rodata` being exactly 320 + 320 + 184 = 824 bytes long.","+/// `sr_idx` is derived from the header and can reach 8 (sample-rate index 3","+/// combined with the MPEG1 / not-MPEG2.5 version bits), which indexes one row","+/// *past* the end of every `[8][...]` table. The C therefore performs an","+/// out-of-bounds read whose result depends purely on how the compiler happened","+/// to lay the tables out in `.rodata` — it is not stable even between two","+/// builds of the C itself (gcc `-O2` reverses the order relative to gcc `-O0`)."," ///","-/// Reproducing that with a single `#[repr(C)]` blob in the same order means","-/// row 8 of `mixed` aliases row 0 of `short`, and row 8 of `short` aliases","-/// row 0 of `long`, exactly as in the C. Row 8 of `long` runs off the end of","-/// the tables in the C too; `tail` provides deterministic zero bytes there so","-/// the translation cannot fault.","+/// The reference build (`c_src/CMakeLists.txt`) sets no `CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE`, so","+/// it compiles at `-O0`, where gcc — and clang at any level — emits the tables","+/// in declaration order:","+///","+/// ```text","+///   g_scf_long   +0     184 bytes","+///   (padding)    +1